<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" version="2.0"><channel><title>Clearly Seen | Romans</title><link>https://romansbook.com/series/clearly-seen/</link><description>Creation bears witness to its Maker: life, strength, wisdom and worship.</description><language>en-US</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 01:18:21 GMT</lastBuildDate><atom:link rel="self" type="application/rss+xml" href="https://romansbook.com/series/clearly-seen/feed.xml" /><item><title>A sea full of wisdom</title><link>https://romansbook.com/series/clearly-seen/a-sea-full-of-wisdom/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://romansbook.com/assets/covers/clearly-seen-a-sea-full-of-wisdom-share.jpg" alt="A sea full of wisdom" width="1200" height="630"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Psalm 104 praises God’s wisdom in a sea full of creatures great and small. Notice the life beneath the surface and let wonder become worship of its Maker.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Clearly Seen · Psalm 104:24–26&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://romansbook.com/series/clearly-seen/a-sea-full-of-wisdom/"&gt;Watch the film and read the narration&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><category>Clearly Seen</category><guid isPermaLink="true">https://romansbook.com/series/clearly-seen/a-sea-full-of-wisdom/</guid><media:thumbnail url="https://romansbook.com/assets/covers/clearly-seen-a-sea-full-of-wisdom-share.jpg" width="1200" height="630" /></item><item><title>Keep sowing without knowing</title><link>https://romansbook.com/series/clearly-seen/keep-sowing/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://romansbook.com/assets/covers/clearly-seen-keep-sowing-share.jpg" alt="Keep sowing without knowing" width="1200" height="630"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ecclesiastes 11 pictures sowing when we cannot know which effort will prosper. Keep your promises and do faithful work while trusting God with its outcome.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Clearly Seen · Ecclesiastes 11:5–6&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://romansbook.com/series/clearly-seen/keep-sowing/"&gt;Watch the film and read the narration&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><category>Clearly Seen</category><guid isPermaLink="true">https://romansbook.com/series/clearly-seen/keep-sowing/</guid><media:thumbnail url="https://romansbook.com/assets/covers/clearly-seen-keep-sowing-share.jpg" width="1200" height="630" /></item><item><title>The God who names the stars</title><link>https://romansbook.com/series/clearly-seen/the-god-who-names-the-stars/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://romansbook.com/assets/covers/clearly-seen-the-god-who-names-the-stars-share.jpg" alt="The God who names the stars" width="1200" height="630"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Isaiah 40 turns weary eyes toward the Creator who names the stars and gives strength. Ask the God who never grows tired for help with your next step.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Clearly Seen · Isaiah 40:26–31&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://romansbook.com/series/clearly-seen/the-god-who-names-the-stars/"&gt;Watch the film and read the narration&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><category>Clearly Seen</category><guid isPermaLink="true">https://romansbook.com/series/clearly-seen/the-god-who-names-the-stars/</guid><media:thumbnail url="https://romansbook.com/assets/covers/clearly-seen-the-god-who-names-the-stars-share.jpg" width="1200" height="630" /></item><item><title>What worry can’t give you</title><link>https://romansbook.com/series/clearly-seen/what-worry-cannot-give/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://romansbook.com/assets/covers/clearly-seen-what-worry-cannot-give-share.jpg" alt="What worry can’t give you" width="1200" height="630"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Jesus points to birds and flowers as he speaks to anxious hearts in Matthew 6. Bring the Father your concerns and seek his kingdom in today’s next step.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Clearly Seen · Matthew 6:25–34&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://romansbook.com/series/clearly-seen/what-worry-cannot-give/"&gt;Watch the film and read the narration&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><category>Clearly Seen</category><guid isPermaLink="true">https://romansbook.com/series/clearly-seen/what-worry-cannot-give/</guid><media:thumbnail url="https://romansbook.com/assets/covers/clearly-seen-what-worry-cannot-give-share.jpg" width="1200" height="630" /></item><item><title>Who holds the world together?</title><link>https://romansbook.com/series/clearly-seen/who-holds-the-world-together/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://romansbook.com/assets/covers/clearly-seen-who-holds-the-world-together-share.jpg" alt="Who holds the world together?" width="1200" height="630"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;God’s questions to Job draw attention to wisdom beyond our understanding. Hebrews 1 points to Christ upholding all things as we bring him our uncertainty.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Clearly Seen · Job 38:4–7 · Hebrews 1:3&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://romansbook.com/series/clearly-seen/who-holds-the-world-together/"&gt;Watch the film and read the narration&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><category>Clearly Seen</category><guid isPermaLink="true">https://romansbook.com/series/clearly-seen/who-holds-the-world-together/</guid><media:thumbnail url="https://romansbook.com/assets/covers/clearly-seen-who-holds-the-world-together-share.jpg" width="1200" height="630" /></item><item><title>Your next breath</title><link>https://romansbook.com/series/clearly-seen/your-next-breath/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://romansbook.com/assets/covers/clearly-seen-your-next-breath-share.jpg" alt="Your next breath" width="1200" height="630"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Acts 17 names life and breath as gifts from the God who made the world. Let an ordinary breath lead to gratitude and love for someone near you today.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Clearly Seen · Acts 17:25&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://romansbook.com/series/clearly-seen/your-next-breath/"&gt;Watch the film and read the narration&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description><category>Clearly Seen</category><guid isPermaLink="true">https://romansbook.com/series/clearly-seen/your-next-breath/</guid><media:thumbnail url="https://romansbook.com/assets/covers/clearly-seen-your-next-breath-share.jpg" width="1200" height="630" /></item></channel></rss>